<p>I didn't get the fairy thing at all (iron thing makes more sense in retrospect, but we do need some more hints to get there)- but I overall liked this on weirdness value and writing. If you can somehow find a picture for one of the recovered objects, that would be great.</p>
<p>The part about the &quot;memetic effect&quot; just being a learned interaction with something else undetectable is cool fridge horror. Making this more obvious couldn't <em>hurt</em>, but it occurred to me when I was reading it.</p>
<p>Consider adding that the &quot;non-visible entities&quot; are intangible as well.</p>

